{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(x-6)^2-12.25\u0026=0\n\\\\\\\\\n(x-6)^2\u0026=12.25\n\\\\\\\\\n\\sqrt{(x-6)^2}\u0026=\\sqrt{12.25}\n\\\\\\\\\nx-6\u0026=\\pm 3.5\n\\\\\\\\\nx\u0026=\\pm3.5+6\n\\\\\\\\\nx=\\goldD{2.5}\u0026\\text{ or }x=\\goldD{9.5}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$f(x)$ is given in vertex form:\n\n$f(x)=(x-\\blueD{6})^2\\maroonD{-12.25}$\n\nSo the vertex of the parabola is at $(\\blueD{6},\\maroonD{-12.25})$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\text{smaller }x\u0026=2.5\n\\\\\\\\\n\\text{larger }x\u0026=9.5\n\\end{align}$\n\nThe vertex of the parabola is at\n\n$(6,-12.25)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$f(x)=(x-6)^2-12.25$\n\n**1) What are the zeros of the function?**  \n*Write the smaller $x$ first, and the larger $x$ second.*\n\n$\\text{smaller }x=$ [[☃ input-number 1]]\n\n$\\text{larger }x=$ [[☃ input-number 2]]\n\n**2) What is the vertex of the parabola?**\n\n$($[[☃ input-number 3]]$,$[[☃ input-number 4]]$)$","images":{},"widgets":{"input-number 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":2.5},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}},"input-number 2":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":9.5},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}},"input-number 3":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":6},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"m